# Stroke of Midnight: a target that is illegal as the spell resolves makes it not resolve at all (CR 608.2b), so nothing is
# destroyed and no Human is created. Bot1 casts it at Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot2 answers with Blossoming Defense, giving
# it hexproof: the spell fizzles, the Ornithopter stays a 2/4 from the Defense, and Bot2 gets no Human.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Stroke of Midnight
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Blossoming Defense
Island x17

